1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:07,720
"That's one small step for man, one giant leap for mankind."

2
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:17,560
In 1969, the year when man for the first time set foot on the moon, an important step for AI research was also taken in Sweden.

3
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:24,920
The same year, Erik Sandewall became the first year in Sweden to defend in artificial intelligence.

4
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:29,040
A research area that was often met with skepticism.

5
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:40,320
In 1975, Linköping University was founded.
An environment filled with new construction spirit and with a great desire for renewal.

6
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:47,480
At LiU, Erik was given the opportunity to create broad basic education specially adapted for AI.

7
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,560
It required courage!

8
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:58,720
Today, Linköping University has over 100 courses in artificial intelligence and expertise in AI at all our institutions.
